# The portable Node runtime is a BUILD ARTIFACT, fetched per-platform at
# build time (CI's "Fetch portable Node runtime" step in
# .github/workflows/build.yml, or the same curl+tar by hand for a local
# `cargo tauri build`). It is ~154MB unpacked with an 88MB `bin/node`.
#
# This file exists because it WAS committed once, by accident, in this
# branch's own history: a `git add -A src-tauri` after a local build staged
# 2,375 files including the 88MB binary. Caught before push and rewritten
# out. An ignore rule is cheaper than remembering.
#
# README.placeholder is deliberately NOT ignored — it is the only thing that
# should ever be tracked here, and its presence is what keeps the directory
# in git so tauri-build's resource resolution finds a real path.
*
!.gitignore
!bin/
bin/*
!bin/README.placeholder
